      "description": "<ul>\n<li>Added ear friendlier config.</li>\n<li>AmbientCompressorSendLevel is now a multiplier.</li>\n<li>For config explanations refer to readme here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/shengzhanzhe/DeepFriedHeadsets4.0.11\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/shengzhanzhe/DeepFriedHeadsets4.0.11</a> under “Configuration”</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>UPDATING FROM PREVIOUS CONFIG</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>If you’ve set a custom config previously and want to keep it, please rename “AmbientCompressorSendLevelAdd” to “AmbientCompressorSendLevel” in config.json. And give it a value between 1-2. Other values are the same.</li>\n</ul>\n",
